35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The bus links are gone in the outer wards. That’s a huge barrier.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed. A mess.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,No one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators. That’s a gap.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,The grant only covers fees for twelve months. Then it’s on the flat budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Attendance at former outreach stops was higher than the main building midweek.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that attendance data is really encouraging for mobile services.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, so the funding dries up after year one? That’s risky.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the repair clinic volunteers are there, but the tool cert guy retired.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that’s a critical skill gap. We can’t assume it’s covered.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The evening rooms are full, but remote use peaks after lock-up.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If we go mobile, we bypass the bus issue entirely.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"But if we repeat the digitisation mistake, we waste resources again.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,We need to verify if the staff can actually handle the new workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The vehicle running costs overran last year. That’s a warning sign.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,A mobile unit could reach the people who can’t come to us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m leaning towards the mobile option. It solves the access problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m wary of the archive, given the past failures.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,The workshop needs certified staff. We don’t have them.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The mobile option has high running costs, but the grant helps initially.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I support the mobile service. It’s the most equitable choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
